   159	### 4.1 Composition identity and layer swaps (Codex finding 11; RULINGS Q28)
   160	
   161	1. **A composition names four assignments:** source of truth, current index, history index, analytical copy, each XTDB or QLever.
   162	2. **Receipts bind every component:** engine image digest, configuration hash and slot per assignment, plus every replication edge (feed
   163	   consumer source hash, translation generation) and each index's watermark at read time.
