   200	| 1 | Monday onboarding rush | A day's 1,300 placements compressed into business hours, with a 10x burst at 9am; workers and recruiters submit forms; every commit triggers a reconcile pull | P1 and P2 bars hold through the burst; no writer waits over 2 s | P1, P2 |
   201	| 2 | Form submit, person waiting | A worker submits I-9 Section 1 (10 facts); the reconcile pull runs immediately at the returned tx | the next task is visible on the first pull, every time; commit p99 ≤ 50 ms under scenario 1's load | P2, P4 |
