   111	| HS-NORMALIZE | RULINGS Q3 | A declared normalization step that reads no data: arithmetic or classification over values already returned by native substeps of the same task (for example BigInt subtraction of two returned sums). It is declared in the frozen task recipe, recorded in the trace, and its time is counted inside the task's measured call. |
