   493	- VC2 binds the control profile identity and the load-contract or threshold registry hash
   494	- VC3 every value is the registry value or tighter, or UNATTAINABLE with its retained measurement
   495	- VC4 every ladder step's raw objects are retained
   496	- VC5 preconditions that are acceptance obligations (for the NS calibration: S.population.year-one for the engine) are evaluated by the VA rules on the control profile; they never depend on VC records
   497	
   498	**VA** (primary acceptance evidence; depends on VC).
   499	- VA1 produced by lab/bin in this repository, append-only, every evidence object present under runs/objects with matching sha256
   500	- VA2 profile identity complete and equal to the candidate profile
   501	- VA3 build first: imported dist hashes produced in this run
   502	- VA4 engine image digest equals the pin or a repaired image declared in this contract version
   503	- VA5 endpoint contacted equals the slot's; never 15442, 17019 or a homebase host
   504	- VA6 contract transitive hash, obligation definition hash, oracle files and case manifests equal the pinned values; every oracle used is ACCEPTED
   505	- VA7 fixture content hash and a fresh scope recorded
   506	- VA8 executed set equals the resolved selection x modes; skipped, unsupported, not-implemented all 0
   507	- VA9 language trace pure for lane receipts; host steps only HS-NORMALIZE and HS-FRONTIER
   508	- VA10 resource admission recorded; not BLOCKED_CAPACITY
   509	- VA11 every threshold used is the registry value or comes from a VC-valid calibration record cited in calibrationRefs
   510	- VA12 no failed acceptance receipt exists for the same obligation, scope key and profile; first failures retained
   511	- VA13 named DIAGNOSTICS executed and retained
   512	- VA14 composition bound: the four assignments with image digest, configuration hash and slot each, every replication edge, and the serving index's watermark at every read; engine-scope keys derived from the assignment (RULINGS Q28)
   513	- VA15 for NS and GS receipts: the trace generator source hash and seed equal the frozen pair of load-contract.json; background and overlay commands accounted separately; the driver-recorded requested basis present for every read
   514	- VA16 the profile is not a screening profile (SCREENING_PROFILES)
   515	
   516	**VM** (mutation evidence; depends on VA).
   517	- VM1 runKind = mutation; profile identity equals a VA-valid acceptance receipt's except the patch; oracle, case and gate hashes identical
   518	- VM2 the patch touches only system-under-test files and is retained
   519	- VM3 reach: the mutant's reach probe fired at least once inside a targeted case
   520	- VM4 kill: at least one targeted case failed by a comparator mismatch on an identified assertion; errors, timeouts, crashes and setup failures do not count
   521	
   522	**VV** (verifier evidence; depends on VA).
   523	- VV1 runKind = verifier; agentId not among authorsOfCodeUnderTest of the verified receipts
   524	- VV2 same profile identity as the verified receipts
   525	- VV3 coverage per the obligation's verifier mode (VERIFIER_MODES)
   526	- VV4 the verifier's own evaluator recomputes every verdict from retained objects; any mismatch fails the obligation
