The generated contract now contains most of the requested controls. The main remaining risk is the meaning of a position: the XTDB brief proposes non-dense engine log offsets, while O-REPLAY still requires consecutive logical positions, and watermark routing compares only the numeric position. I’m checking the resulting gaps separately from the findings that are closed.

