329:## 8. Recommended XTDB role per layer
347:1. **Source of truth:** XTDB can hold it. Correctness features are native (atomic multi-table commit, `ASSERT`, `METADATA`). Constraints: no change stream (build the feed), log retention defeats `ERASE` (use crypto-shredding), and p50 sits above the 10 ms bar on this host.
